{"unit_id":"SnowCrescenter-tech__dsh-milestone#card-zh","repo":"SnowCrescenter-tech/dsh-milestone","commit":"3bdd8d1327f30b64a1119aeb62c752ef1e12c713","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-milestone 是面向 DSH Web 的会话导航插件，在框架浮层中加入按会话显示的里程碑时间线。它从完整会话事件投影生成每条用户提问的标记和轮次元数据，悬停可查看时间、耗时、模型与 token 信息，点击可定位消息。用户还可搜索当前会话或跨会话内容、查看全部提问、收藏书签、键盘导航，并将时间线折叠为可拖动的小球。适合需要在长对话中快速回看和跳转的 DSH Web 用户。安装使用 DSH 插件命令；不需 API Key，偏好和书签保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:65-92"]}
{"unit_id":"SnowCrescenter-tech__dsh-milestone#card-en","repo":"SnowCrescenter-tech/dsh-milestone","commit":"3bdd8d1327f30b64a1119aeb62c752ef1e12c713","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-milestone adds a prompt timeline to DSH Web. Hover to see turn details and click to jump to a message. Search within or across sessions, browse prompts, save bookmarks, use keyboard navigation, or collapse the rail into a draggable ball. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:65-92"]}
